!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.7  Foreign Object Control (FOD) & Quality Compliance (QP.46) — Activity
|Personnel|
start
:Perform daily FOD inspection;
:Practice clean-as-you-go;
:Maintain tool / TPME accountability (QP.38);
if (FOD incident or lost tool?) then (yes)
  :Report incident / missing item;
  |Supervisor|
  :Cease operations; investigate cause;
  :Raise incident report
  (part, serial, root cause, action);
  |FOD Focal Point|
  :Track & trend analysis;
  :Provide feedback & corrective action;
else (no)
endif
|Personnel|
:Attend FOD training (initial + annual, QP.10);
|QAD|
:Conduct IQA audit;
:Yearly performance review;
stop
